<title>SPAIN: Moody's ups BCH parent outlook to stable.</title>
<headline>Moody's ups BCH parent outlook to stable.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. rating agency Moody's said on Monday it raised the outlook for the parent company of Banco Central Hispanoamericano SA to stable from negative.</p>
<p>The change reflects &quot;the improvement in the balane sheet's quality and the efforts to reduce the operating costs and to rearrange the industrial investments,&quot; a note said.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
